  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Uganda Learning, Accountability and Research Network (U-LEARN)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this component is to support the delivery of UK development initiatives by promoting the use of evidence and refugee voice across the refugee response including for programme partners. This is to be achieved through output four - to monitor, evaluate, research, learn, adapt and influence in the Humanitarian sector in Uganda</narrative>
  </description>
